<stereotypeDefinition id="88722cfc-8f4e-4cc2-96f5-3635f5b520d1" version="3.1.0">
  <comment>Optional overrides for the file the guardrail contract is merged into. Set only what differs from the convention: Filename when the existing file's name differs from the type name or the file holds several types; Namespace when the file's namespace differs from the one derived from its folders.</comment>
